me": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "6. While X is legendary for his \"silver or lead\" philosophy, his organization’s accounting department faced two bizarre recurring expenses. Every month, they spent roughly $2,500 on rubber bands—not for office paperwork, but simply to bundle his liquid assets. Even more startlingly, X routinely wrote off 10% of his annual wealth (approximately $2 billion) as a total loss. The reason for this \"tax\" wasn't government seizures, but a biological one: his storage warehouses were so damp and infested that rats were literally eating the cash. Identify X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:00Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "Haji mastan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:05Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Eacobar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:09Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Pablo", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:10Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Earphones", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:11Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Veerppan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:14Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Escobar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Plata o plomo", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:20Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Escobar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:23:27Z", "username"